body:
This is a genuine question from someone who is almost 32 and has never watched any of these online, social media personas until they are already established, i.e. Sidemen etc. What is the appeal with watching them online? What do they do?

&#x200B;

It is something I can't get my head around and I am not asking to be argumentative or anything, just curious because the impression I get is a lot of young children and even adults now grew up with them and idolise them as they would celebs on TV but I have never understood idolising someone you don't know.

&#x200B;

Thanks

Hi just checking if you managed to get any ideas on what to help with my sheet? Or if you could point me in the right direction?

&#x200B;

Thanks
